{"id":"e138531b17f3eae8","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-cfg-unit-elimination.md","title":"单位产生式闭包与消除","display":"df-cfg-unit-elimination — 单位产生式闭包与消除","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-cfg-unit-elimination","aliases":["73-df-cfg-unit-elimination"],"display":"df-cfg-unit-elimination — 单位产生式闭包与消除","depends_on":["[[73-df-cfg-generated-language]]","[[73-df-finite-path-closure]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§7.1, print pp. 261–275; PDF pp. 283–297; local effective construction","source_status":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"Theorem 4.4, pp. 91–92; scans 99–100","legacy_source_status":"book-based-local-formalization","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":7},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-cfg-unit-elimination"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-cfg-unit-elimination</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cfg-unit-elimination — 单位产生式闭包与消除"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"97562bc4aa1d6014\" href=\"?note=97562bc4aa1d6014\" title=\"73-df-cfg-generated-language\">73-df-cfg-generated-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"25902d0bd75ea963\" href=\"?note=25902d0bd75ea963\" title=\"73-df-finite-path-closure\">73-df-finite-path-closure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§7.1, print pp. 261–275; PDF pp. 283–297; local effective construction"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"Theorem 4.4, pp. 91–92; scans 99–100"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"7"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span>；推导语言见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"97562bc4aa1d6014\" href=\"?note=97562bc4aa1d6014\" title=\"73-df-cfg-generated-language\">73-df-cfg-generated-language</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RTC}_V\">\\(\\operatorname{RTC}_V\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"25902d0bd75ea963\" href=\"?note=25902d0bd75ea963\" title=\"73-df-finite-path-closure\">73-df-finite-path-closure</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in V\">\\(A,B\\in V\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}unit\\text{-}elimination}\\vdash\nU_G\\coloneqq\\{(A,B)\\in V^2:(A,\\langle B\\rangle)\\in P\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{Unit}_G\\coloneqq\\operatorname{RTC}_V(U_G)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}unit\\text{-}elimination}\\vdash\nU_G\\coloneqq\\{(A,B)\\in V^2:(A,\\langle B\\rangle)\\in P\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{Unit}_G\\coloneqq\\operatorname{RTC}_V(U_G)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}unit\\text{-}elimination}\\vdash\nP^{\\mathsf u}\\coloneqq\\{(A,\\alpha)\\in V\\times(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*: \\alpha\\notin V^1\\land\\exists B\\in V\\;((A,B)\\in\\operatorname{Unit}_G\\land(B,\\alpha)\\in P)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}unit\\text{-}elimination}\\vdash\nP^{\\mathsf u}\\coloneqq\\{(A,\\alpha)\\in V\\times(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*: \\alpha\\notin V^1\\land\\exists B\\in V\\;((A,B)\\in\\operatorname{Unit}_G\\land(B,\\alpha)\\in P)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}unit\\text{-}elimination}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{NoUnit}(G)\\coloneqq(V,\\Sigma,P^{\\mathsf u},S)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}unit\\text{-}elimination}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{NoUnit}(G)\\coloneqq(V,\\Sigma,P^{\\mathsf u},S)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>反身闭包保留原非单位产生式，传递部分跳过任意长的单位链。空产生式不属于单位产生式，因此本构造可用于含空词的文法。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-cfg-generated-language","status":"resolved","id":"97562bc4aa1d6014","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-generated-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-path-closure","status":"resolved","id":"25902d0bd75ea963","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-path-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-generated-language","status":"resolved","id":"97562bc4aa1d6014","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}$；推导语言见 [[73-df-cfg-generated-language]]，$\\operatorname{RTC}_V$ 见 [[73-df-finite-path-closure]]。$A,B\\in V$。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-path-closure","status":"resolved","id":"25902d0bd75ea963","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}$；推导语言见 [[73-df-cfg-generated-language]]，$\\operatorname{RTC}_V$ 见 [[73-df-finite-path-closure]]。$A,B\\in V$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RTC}_V","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}unit\\text{-}elimination}\\vdash\nU_G\\coloneqq\\{(A,B)\\in V^2:(A,\\langle B\\rangle)\\in P\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{Unit}_G\\coloneqq\\operatorname{RTC}_V(U_G)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}unit\\text{-}elimination}\\vdash\nP^{\\mathsf u}\\coloneqq\\{(A,\\alpha)\\in V\\times(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*: \\alpha\\notin V^1\\land\\exists B\\in V\\;((A,B)\\in\\operatorname{Unit}_G\\land(B,\\alpha)\\in P)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}unit\\text{-}elimination}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{NoUnit}(G)\\coloneqq(V,\\Sigma,P^{\\mathsf u},S)","display":true}],"bytes":1836,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-124","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-unit-elimination|单位产生式闭包与消除]]"},{"id":"77959a5a83dc456a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}$，$\\operatorname{NoUnit}(G)=(V,\\Sigma,P^{\\mathsf u},S)$，见 [[73-df-cfg-unit-elimination]]。"}],"outgoing":["97562bc4aa1d6014","25902d0bd75ea963"]}